    {
      "index": 6,
      "phase": "DISCUSSION",
      "speaker_id": "p2",
      "speaker_name": "Ben",
      "text": "Strongest compute performance is appealing but comes with heavier weight and more power use. If battery is priority, the battery laptop’s longevity outweighs graphics concerns for me.",
